        {
            "id": "6D87C669-A474-4E35-A109-DFCB442D85B0",
            "name": "Ardgowan Hospice",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "Ardgowan Hospice&nbsp;is a compassionate place of care for people living in Inverclyde who have been diagnosed with a life limiting illness, such as cancer, heart failure, lung disease, kidney failure or neurological conditions.\r\n\r\nMaking patients, families and carers feel at ease is one of the first things we do at Ardgowan Hospice.\r\n",
