        {
            "id": "88B5FA08-F3AB-4A33-A31F-B55AFF572AAF",
            "name": "Voluntary Action Islington",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "Voluntary Action Islington (VAI) is the umbrella body for Islington&rsquo;s diverse Voluntary, Community, Faith, and Social Enterprise (VCFSE) sector and has been providing infrastructure support services in the borough for over 50 years.\r\n\r\nWe offer a wide range of services for local organisations, small groups, and volunteers at all stages of their development. These services range from one-to-one support, through training and workshops.\r\nWe pride ourselves on excellence and quality, and we aim to lead and support a resilient local voluntary sector that actively collaborates to support residents and the community.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n",
            "applylink": "https://volunteer.vai.org.uk/volunteers/provider-profile/voluntary-action-islington",
            "email": "volunteer@vai.org.uk",
            "phone": "07354459113",
            "website": "https://volunteer.vai.org.uk/volunteers/provider-profile/voluntary-action-islington",
            "location": [
                {
                    "address": "200a Pentonville Road",
                    "latitude": 51.5312384,
                    "longitude": -0.1177161
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "C271DA8B-3762-4AD8-A774-0D18BB370D51",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "YHA Patterdale is located in the Lake District National Park, in the heart of the picturesque Ullswater Valley. We are at the foot of Helvellyn, England&#39;s third highest mountain and Ullswater is just a&nbsp;twenty minute walk away. There is some of the UK&#39;s best&nbsp;walking, canoeing, cycling and mountain biking to be found on our doorstep, and with a regular bus route between Penrith and Windermere you are never far from civilisation.\r\n\r\nBuilt in the 1970s and with a unique look all of its own, this Scandinavian style rural retreat is lively, retro and full of character!\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking to complete a hostel placement over several weeks or to take part in a volunteer working party or DofE residential event, we will help to make you feel welcome and part of the team. We love the help and support of our volunteers at YHA Patterdale so please, sign up!\r\n\r\nVolunteering with YHA is a fantastic way to have fun, learn new skills, boost your CV and travel to different places. We have a variety of different opportunities to choose from and volunteering roles to suit everyone. &nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe tasks are varied and in return you will meet some great people, who both work and stay in our hostels, as well as enjoying your time off discovering the local area and attractions.\r\n",
            "applylink": "https://volunteer.yha.org.uk/volunteers/provider-profile/YHAPatterdale",
            "email": "patterdalemanager@yha.org.uk",
            "phone": "01768 482394",
            "website": "https://volunteer.yha.org.uk/volunteers/provider-profile/YHAPatterdale",
            "location": [
                {
                    "address": "Patterdale, Penrith, Cumbria",
                    "latitude": 54.66422,
                    "longitude": -2.78611
                }
            ]
        },
