        {
            "id": "FDB1A393-4D3A-467E-8835-4084523CFA4F",
            "name": "Renfrewshire Council Youth Services",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "Renfrewshire Council Youth Services&nbsp;deliver a range of youth work activities&nbsp;in schools and communities across Renfrewshire.\r\n\r\nOur Service aim is to improve the outcomes for young people in Renfrewshire through youth work, youth information, empowerment activities and outdoor learning.\r\n\r\nWe work with young people aged 11 to 25 years old, and includes support for young people who experience challenges and are vulnerable and&nbsp;in need of additional support.\r\n\r\nOur service activities include:\r\n\r\n\r\n\tYouth voice groups and empowerment programmes - where young people can have a say and lead on projects and campaigns that matter to them\r\n\tPeer led education - where young people can take a lead on youth consutlation and delivering training and information to their peers\r\n\tYoung Scot and the National Entitlement Card in Renfrewshire - young people can take part&nbsp;in local and national inititatives, and collect rewards and experiences linked to the YS Card&nbsp;\r\n\tCommunity based youth clubs - based in neighburhood community bases providing drop-in and clubs for young people on their&nbsp;door-step\r\n\tAccess to youth information - finding out on opportunities for volunteering, and activites that can help connect young people to local and digital support services\r\n\tOutdoor learning activities - encouraging young people to take part in outdoor activites and promoting positive mental health and wellbeing\r\n\tAccredited awards and volunteering (e.g. Duke of Edinburgh&#39;s Award, Youth Achievement Awards)\r\n\r\n\r\nYouth Services welcome anyone 16+yrs&nbsp; who want to take on a volnteering role with us; this can include working alonside our youth workers to deliver activity programmes, in helping to plan and organise youth events to creating digital blogs and media.\r\n\r\nContact details: youth@renfrewshire.gov.uk\r\n",
            "applylink": "https://volunteer.engagerenfrewshire.org/volunteers/provider-profile/renfrewshire-gov-ukarticle4396Youth-Services",
            "email": "youth@renfrewshire.gov.uk",
            "phone": "+447506966776",
