            "name": "Moss Side Powerhouse Library",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "&nbsp;\r\n\r\nIf this is Manchester&rsquo;s coolest local library it&rsquo;s because the local teenagers who use it also designed it. The interior is filled with vibrant, bold colours, furnishings and fabrics, a perfect setting for picking up a book or using our free wifi.\r\nWe may be in a purpose built youth centre &ndash; thus the youth services and graphic novels, teen fiction, and books for young mums and dads &ndash; but this library values older people too! ESOL classes, the knitting group and the job club and IT class&nbsp;are for all to enjoy.\r\n",
