        {
            "id": "9B842457-F30D-4B75-A224-9B08D0D59444",
            "name": "The Reader",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "Love books? Love people? Then find out how you can volunteer with The Reader.\r\n\r\nThe Reader is based in Liverpool and works across England and Wales to set up Shared Reading groups.\r\n\r\nShared Reading is a great way for people to meet up and read and listen to brilliant stories and poems. Then we talk about them. There&#39;s never any pressure&nbsp;to read aloud or talk. Listening is fine too. And we can talk about them in any way we want to. They might spark a memory or there might be a character we like, or a word or phrase that stands out.&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWe already suppport Shared Reading in Warrington Hospital and LifeTime Gateway and we&#39;re looking to expand our work in Warrington so we are looking for new volunteers to help start groups as Reader Leaders. New groups might be in community centres, cafes, a bookshop or other places. We find the locations and set it all up - although suggestions for new venues are always welcome. Perhaps you know somewhere.&nbsp;\r\n\r\nAll our groups are led by Reader Leaders. A Reader Leader gets full training and ongoing support from our excellent team.&nbsp;\r\n\r\nTo volunteer with us, you have to enjoy reading a wide variety of material. You have to&nbsp; be available 4 hours per week or fortnight to prepare and deliver a session. Training is&nbsp;on Zoom, for 6 half day sessions over 6 weeks. Groups are held in weekday daytimes - so this is when you have to be available.&nbsp;\r\n",
            "applylink": "https://volunteering.warringtonva.org.uk/volunteers/provider-profile/TheReader",
            "email": "michaelprior@thereader.org.uk",
            "phone": "07949143022",
            "website": "https://volunteering.warringtonva.org.uk/volunteers/provider-profile/TheReader",
            "location": [
                {
                    "address": "The Reader Organisation The Mansion House",
                    "latitude": 53.380104064941406,
                    "longitude": -2.88960862159729
                }
            ]
        },
