        {
            "id": "F46CB669-64A6-453E-8846-08EDD31C6486",
            "name": "IAPWA (International Aid for Protection and Welfare of Animals)",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "IAPWA (International Aid for the Protection &amp; Welfare of Animals) is a UK registered international animal welfare charity, dedicated to creating a better future for animals in need.\r\n\r\nOur first project, established in 2009, was based in Sabah, Borneo, where we have provided a lifeline to thousands of dogs and cats in need of veterinary care and support. Our companion animal programmes have since developed in Penang Island and Romania.\r\n\r\nOur passion for all animals has also seen us develop partnerships and campaigns to help other species. Wherever there is suffering, we aim to make a difference and with your support we can continue to protect and improve the welfare of animals worldwide.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n",
            "applylink": "https://oxonvolunteers.org/volunteers/provider-profile/IAPWA",
            "email": "fundraising@iapwa.org",
            "phone": "07939226479",
            "website": "https://oxonvolunteers.org/volunteers/provider-profile/IAPWA",
