        {
            "id": "3050C306-B9E2-403E-B8E9-CDD99FC6091A",
            "name": "SeeSaw",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "About SeeSaw\r\n\r\nSeeSaw provides grief support for children, young people and their families in Oxfordshire.&nbsp; Through appropriate and timely support, SeeSaw can help to reduce the emotional, psychological and mental health consequences of bereavement.&nbsp; Young people are then able to face the future with hope.\r\n",
