            "description": "Heaton Moor RUFC is&nbsp;an inclusive community based rugby union&nbsp;club in South Manchester. &nbsp;The club has three senior men&#39;s teams along with a thriving mini and junior section with 250 players from age 5 to 18. &nbsp;The club is situated near Heaton Chapel station and is close to&nbsp;several main bus routes. &nbsp;We provide various volunteering opportunities involving coaching mini and junior teams, refereeing and events management. &nbsp;The club provides funding for all our volunteers to pursue RFU qualifications. &nbsp;Our senior men&#39;s teams welcome all new players with any level of skill and experience. &nbsp;We already have MMU students playing in our teams and provide a warm social welcome to new players.\r\n",
            "applylink": "https://mmusv.com/volunteers/provider-profile/HeatonMoorRUFC",
            "email": "info@heatonmoorrugby.co.uk",
            "phone": "07540427234",
            "website": "https://mmusv.com/volunteers/provider-profile/HeatonMoorRUFC",
            "location": [
