            "name": "Lache Youth Club",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "Lache Youth Club was started in November 2021, this is following a youth club shutting prior to Covid.\r\n\r\nThe newly established youth club is primary managed by Youth workers at St Marks Church and Sanctuary housing Youth worker, along with volunteers.\r\n\r\nThe youth club currently has approx 50 member aged between 7-11 years old.\r\n\r\nWe run on a Friday evening from 4.30-6pm.\r\n\r\nThe youth club has lots of different activities from, pool, dance, art &amp; crafts, sports and lots of more, the young people whom attend are always interested in trying out new and exciting activities.\r\n",
