            "description": "The Westmorland and Furness Cohesion Group&#39;s mission is to create safe, connected communities characterised by resilience, mutual respect, understanding and a sense of identity and belonging for everyone in Westmorland &amp; Furness.\r\n\r\nOur group is formed of a wide range of members from across Westmorland and Furness including charities, voluntary organisations, sports groups, public organisations and business who work together to achieve our mission.&nbsp;\r\n\r\nTo achieve our mission we will run and support a number of activities, and need enthusiastic volunteers to help.\r\n",
