            "name": "British Red Cross",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "The British Red Cross helps millions of people in the UK and around the world get the support they need when crisis strikes.&nbsp;Whether you&#39;re affected by an emergency overseas or here at home, we provide guidance to help you know what to do before, during and after an emergency. Community Education is one way we support people by delivering workshops to community groups to give them skills to help them cope with an emergency.\r\n",
