        {
            "id": "F27374EE-75C0-41C5-A5D9-D59E813A1881",
            "name": "Carer Support South Lakes",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "Carer Support South Lakes is an independent local&nbsp;charity that provides&nbsp;a range of services to support and enhance the lives of unpaid Carers of all ages throughout South Lakeland.\r\n\r\nWe are one of 4&nbsp;charities&nbsp;that make up&nbsp;Carer Support Cumbria and we are a&nbsp;network partner of Carers Trust.\r\n",
