        {
            "id": "A421E667-EA43-45CF-AB05-AC79288D61D0",
            "name": "Refugee Education UK",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "Refugee Education UK&nbsp;helps refugee and asylum-seeking children and young people build more hopeful futures through education.\r\n\r\nREUK&nbsp;works with young people displaced by conflict or crisis and helps&nbsp;them get into, stay&nbsp;and thrive in education. We do this through three key programmes: educational mentoring, educational progression and wellbeing. REUK is also involved in research,&nbsp;consultancy, and advocacy, and runs training for practictioners.\r\n\r\nThe educational mentoring programme offers bespoke educational mentoring&nbsp;to young refugees, asylum seekers and survivors of trafficking across Oxford, London, the West Midlands and the East of England. This is the key area where REUK relies on volunteers, to support young people with 1:1 weekly sessions as their mentors.\r\n\r\nHow does mentoring work?\r\n\r\n- REUK&nbsp;takes referrals of young people from schools and colleges, social services and a variety of other organisations and individuals\r\n- We meet the young person for an initial assessment of their educational aspirations and current circumstances\r\n- We match the individual young person with a trained, local volunteer mentor (this could be you!)\r\n- The mentor meets the young person for an hour each week, in a public place, to support them towards their educational goal\r\n- We ask for a minimum commitment of six month from both the young person and the mentor. After six months the relationship is reviewed to see if both mentor and mentee would like to continue\r\n- The REUK local Mentoring Coordinator provides continued support to mentor and mentee all along their relationship\r\n",
            "applylink": "https://oxonvolunteers.org/volunteers/provider-profile/refugeeeducationvolunteers",
            "email": "giulia@reuk.org",
            "phone": "07562262718",
            "website": "https://oxonvolunteers.org/volunteers/provider-profile/refugeeeducationvolunteers",
            "location": [
                {
                    "address": "The Old Schoolhouse",
                    "latitude": 51.7423292,
                    "longitude": -1.2318093
                }
            ]
        },
