        {
            "id": "8A6E362B-734E-4DBC-90A6-BCA68063996E",
            "name": "The Glowsticks Project",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "Hello, and welcome to The Glowsticks Project!\r\n\r\nOur charity exists to support children, young people and adults with Autism and ADHD (and co-existing conditions). We have many different provisions that we run, such as 5 and under stay and play, crafts, forest school, art therapy and much more.&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWe run a Cafe that is open to the public 5 days a week with a hugely diverse workforce with a combination of volunteers and paid staff: 80% of our people have Autism and/or ADHD, including the founder, Rebecca, who also has Autism.&nbsp;\r\n\r\nOn site, we have a sensory room, games consoles, a pool table and lots more for our young people and children!\r\n\r\nOur cafe is a cololurful, welcoming happy place and have been recently awarded Dementia Friendly accreditation too because of the environment we have created.&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWe serve a lovely variety of meals and hot drinks - come and see us!&nbsp;\r\n",
            "applylink": "https://mvda.teamkinetic.co.uk/volunteers/provider-profile/TheGlowsticksProject",
            "email": "hr@theglowsticksproject.org.uk",
            "phone": "07707136573",
            "website": "https://mvda.teamkinetic.co.uk/volunteers/provider-profile/TheGlowsticksProject",
            "location": [
                {
                    "address": "The Glowsticks Project Cafe & Hub",
                    "latitude": 54.577968597412109,
                    "longitude": -1.2353787422180176
                }
            ]
        },
