        {
            "id": "88A44C20-9712-4563-AC08-1035330CD043",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "\r\n\r\nLiving Well Occupational Therapy is a community interest company providing support&nbsp;to those who live with chronic illness and long-term health conditions in Northamptonshire.&nbsp;\r\n\r\nKnowing that chronic illness and long term conditions affect a person&rsquo;s whole life, we take a whole life approach, supporting individuals to self-manage, live well with their condition and increase resilience and life satisfaction.\r\n\r\nOccupational therapy helps people of all ages overcome challenges and complete everyday tasks or activities, we aim to ensure that the activities that our community want to participate in are accessible and available to them.\r\n\r\nWe offer courses, groups, advice, education and support to help you to stay well and to manage life, health and wellbeing your way\r\n",
            "applylink": "https://volunteerpassport.co.uk/volunteers/provider-profile/LivingWellOccupationalTherapyCIC",
            "email": "dawn@livingwellot.co.uk",
            "phone": "07512187404",
