                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "BCA55433-40BA-45B5-85DF-A80E3040EDF0",
            "name": "Army Cadet Force",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "description": "FUN, FRIENDSHIP, ACTION AND ADVENTURE\r\n\r\nTry something truly extraordinary with the Army Cadets, one of the UK&rsquo;s leading youth organisations. Every year, thousands of young people (aged 12 to 18) and adult volunteers join the fun, friendship, action, and adventure.\r\n\r\nSTART YOUR JOURNEY AS AN ARMY CADET VOLUNTEER\r\n\r\nMake a difference in young lives while gaining new skills, friendships, and unforgettable experiences. Join the Army Cadets as an adult volunteer!\r\n\r\nWe have thousands of enthusiastic and committed adult volunteers who help to lead, guide and inspire our cadets, but we need more.\r\n\r\nWhen you speak to our adult volunteers, they will tell you they do it because they love it. They enjoy the fun, friendship, action and adventure the Army Cadets provide. They also enjoy making a real difference to young people in their community &ndash; helping to inspire them to achieve, building their confidence, and encouraging them to think for themselves and to act for others.\r\n\r\nJoining the Army Cadets is a great way to meet like-minded people and have fun and in return for your time and effort, we will give you the chance to learn new skills, gain new qualifications and help develop your leadership potential.\r\n",
            "applylink": "https://lovevolunteering.co.uk/volunteers/provider-profile/ArmyCadetForce",
            "email": "james.edwards@armymail.mod.uk",
            "phone": "01432 359917",
            "website": "https://lovevolunteering.co.uk/volunteers/provider-profile/ArmyCadetForce",
            "location": [
                {
                    "address": "The John Hewlett Cadet Centre, Great Western Avenue,",
                    "latitude": 52.190708160400391,
                    "longitude": -2.2089855670928955
                }
            ]
        },
